.TH AUDIO_INIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
audio_init \- Engine\-internal: open the default playback device
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqaudio.h\(dq
.BI "bool audio_init(void);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Engine\-internal: open the default playback device. Called by engine_init() when EngineConfig.audio is set; games never call it.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true on success.
.SH MODULE
audio (src/engine/audio/audio.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_init (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
